# qed.ui command palette plugin: fuzzy list, scoped Next/Previous/Run, Esc, outside click.
file long.txt
short line
The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog, and then it keeps running across the field, past the barn, over the hill, and far beyond the river until the sun goes down.
end
run long.txt
wait short line
key ctrl+p
wait Command Palette
snap open
type tog
snap filtered
key down down up
snap moved
key esc
snap closed
key ctrl+p
type linewrap
snap wrap
key enter
snap unwrapped
key ctrl+p
wait Command Palette
click 2 20
snap outside
